---
---

<section id="process" class="journey-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-route highlight-gold"></i>
        <span>TRANSPARENT PROCESS</span>
      </span>
      <h2>
        How We Guide You to <span class="editorial-italic highlight-gold">Your Family Home</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        From your initial WhatsApp query to computerized land registry verification and final keys—every phase is conducted with full transparency.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="workflow-grid">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="step-card v4-card">
        <div class="step-num-badge">01</div>
        <div class="step-icon-wrap">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-phone highlight-gold"></i>
        </div>
        <h3>1. Share Your Requirement</h3>
        <p>Tell Naeem your target area (e.g. Model Town, Hayat Abad, Housing Colony), preferred house size (5, 7, 10, 12 Marla), and budget.</p>
        <div class="step-tags">
          <span><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp highlight-teal"></i> WhatsApp / Call</span>
          <span><i class="fa-solid fa-ruler highlight-teal"></i> Size & Budget</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="step-card v4-card">
        <div class="step-num-badge">02</div>
        <div class="step-icon-wrap">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-car highlight-gold"></i>
        </div>
        <h3>2. Shortlist & Site Visit</h3>
        <p>We match your profile against verified listings. Naeem organizes on-site inspections so you can inspect room layouts, road width, and utilities.</p>
        <div class="step-tags">
          <span><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check highlight-teal"></i> Genuine Shortlist</span>
          <span><i class="fa-solid fa-eye highlight-teal"></i> Physical Inspection</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="step-card v4-card">
        <div class="step-num-badge">03</div>
        <div class="step-icon-wrap">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-file-shield highlight-gold"></i>
        </div>
        <h3>3. Record & Fard Due Diligence</h3>
        <p>Before any token payment, we guide you through Arazi Record Center (PLRA) checks, verifying computerized Fard Malkiat, Khatoni, and title history.</p>
        <div class="step-tags">
          <span><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved highlight-teal"></i> PLRA Fard Check</span>
          <span><i class="fa-solid fa-stamp highlight-teal"></i> Registry Review</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="step-card v4-card">
        <div class="step-num-badge">04</div>
        <div class="step-icon-wrap">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-key highlight-gold"></i>
        </div>
        <h3>4. Fair Deal & Key Handover</h3>
        <p>Direct buyer-seller negotiation with zero artificial price bumps. Complete assistance through official transfer protocols and possession handover.</p>
        <div class="step-tags">
          <span><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake highlight-teal"></i> Direct Negotiation</span>
          <span><i class="fa-solid fa-house-chimney-user highlight-teal"></i> Key Handover</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .journey-section {
    padding: 90px 0;
    background: var(--bg-main);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .workflow-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-card {
    padding: 32px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-num-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 20px;
    right: 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(184, 138, 59, 0.25);
  }

  .step-icon-wrap {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-control);
    background: rgba(184, 138, 59, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(184, 138, 59, 0.3);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .step-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .step-card p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .step-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .step-tags span {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .workflow-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .workflow-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
